# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  06_diagnostics.plnt
#  Demonstrates the visual Storm diagnostic panel (line/column
#  tracking + caret pointer). This file INTENTIONALLY contains
#  a broken reference on line 9 to trigger MISSING_STORM and
#  showcase the precision error locator. Run it directly:
#
#     node chloroplast.js run examples/06_diagnostics.plnt
#
#  Expected: a clean ⛈️  panel pointing at the exact column,
#  not a raw JS stack trace, and the process exits(1) cleanly
#  rather than crashing the shell.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
MISSION: SAFE.

1\ CREATE subtotal(NUM) TO 200.
1\ CREATE tax_rate(SCL) TO 0.08.
1\ SHOW subtotal.

# Typo below: "subtotl" instead of "subtotal" — triggers MISSING_STORM
1\ SHOW subtotl.
